  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3074\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JrzCU1S.png\" alt=\"在 Sparked Host 服务器使用代码 JACOS 享受 25% 折扣\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fJacosvaldo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-我的其他项目-00AF5C?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth - 我的其他项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fcPYyf3JqgU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Jacosvaldo_的没那么酷服务器-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord - Jacosvaldo 的没那么酷服务器\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjacosvaldo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/kofi-打赏我-F26B2E?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi\" alt=\"Kofi - 打赏我\"></a></p>\n<h2>🧩 依赖项</h2>\n<p>必须安装 <strong>OptiFine</strong> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>！</p>\n<h2>⚠️ 连接系列</h2>\n<p>此纹理属于一个纹理系列。建议同时查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-rocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connected Rocks</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-bricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connected-Bricks</a></p>\n<p>为了获得更好的渲染顺序，资源包选项卡中的纹理应按以下顺序排列：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9126b58d2dcdd4ae5e3c440e94db630b65e5222b.png\" alt=\"渲染顺序\"></p>\n<h2>🛠️ 模组支持</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模组</th>\n<th>支持状态</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Cobblemon</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>1.7.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cobblemon: Mega Showdown</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>1.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Biomes O' Plenty</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>21.1.0.13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh The Biomes We've Gone</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>2.5.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh The Biomes You'll Go</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BetterNether</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>21.0.11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BetterEnd</td>\n<td>当与 Sodium 不冲突时</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deeper and Darker</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>1.3.3-plus-b-rc2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Regions Unexplored</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>0.5.6.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pyrellium</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>0.2.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Create</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wilder Wild</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Immersive Weathering</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Twigs</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alex's Caves</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ad Astra</td>\n<td>计划中</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>使用不同版本的模组也能正常工作，但如果添加了新方块，它们可能无法与其他方块连接。您可以在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cPYyf3JqgU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Jacosvaldo/Connected-Paths/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上报告问题并提出添加其他模组支持的建議。</strong></p>\n<h2>🔍 预览</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Nyfj98b5/images/2434dbb76ef084dc964bbca003cfd54d4ed2e951.png\" alt=\"路径示例\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Nyfj98b5/images/f6c6d41b56c69628243a81ec09642511ec8296b0.png\" alt=\"方块交互\"></p>",
